      "value": "Anyone on VRChat (ages 13+) can get age verified, so it's unclear what this would try to accomplish in the literal sense. Age Gating to ages 18+ would be a different subject.\n\nThis feature request doesn't change what [Creator Guidelines](https://hello.vrchat.com/creator-guidelines) / [Community Guidelines](https://hello.vrchat.com/community-guidelines) says at the time of writing this about prohibiting sharing sexually explicit or provocative content or paraphernalia, where the content scanning and blocking is used for safety of everyone, including adults.",
