  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Instead of erroring out when theres something nsfw in the image, it should tag the print as age verified and you can only see it if your account has been age verified. Kinda similarily to age verified instances you can create with group but for prints. It however should only tag it as so iftheres nsfw material in the picture obviously",
